Added: A new cookbook for a pressurized magma chamber in a highly viscous compressible
 material. This is an example of dilation through compositional heating of a thermally
expansive material model. It is modeled after the benchmark of a spherical magma chamber
in elastic half-space commonly used by volcanologists.
<br>
(Annie Thompson, Cedric Thieulot 2026/07/25)
